{"4910920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HeadOn - Body Cam Shooter Game", "steam_appid": 4910920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiplayer combat from a true bodycam perspective. Fine-tune your loadout, master realistic gunplay, and take on players in action-packed matches built around skill and tactics.<br><br>⚔️ Fight Online</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on players from around the world in competitive 6v6 matches across multiple game modes, including Team Deathmatch, Domination, and Free-for-All. Every match is a new challenge that rewards both aim and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔫 Master Every Weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a large arsenal of firearms, unlock upgrades, attach new equipment, and create a loadout that fits your playstyle. Every weapon handles differently, giving you plenty of ways to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 Adapt to Every Situation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashbangs, frag grenades, stun grenades, night vision goggles, and tactical equipment give you more than firepower. Use the right tools at the right moment to control the battlefield and gain the advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Train Before You Compete</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice offline against AI opponents, experiment with different weapons, and sharpen your skills before jumping into online matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📹 Feel Every Engagement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive bodycam perspective, natural weapon movement, dynamic camera effects, and detailed sound design make every firefight feel intense from start to finish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're pushing objectives with your squad or clutching the final round alone, every fight is a chance to prove your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience multiplayer combat f